OL,3,AEmmys 2026: The winners and nominations
OL,4,Alist
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Emmy Awards take place in Los
OL,7,FAngeles on Monday, with The Pitt, Hacks
OL,8,Fand Beef among the shows competing for
OL,9,Ftrophies.
OL,11,FMany of this year's prizes have already
OL,12,Fbeen handed out at the earlier Creative
OL,13,FArts Emmys, leaving only the most
OL,14,Fhigh-profile categories for the big
OL,15,Fnight.
OL,17,FFollow live: The Emmy Awards 2026
OL,19,FHere are the nominations for the main
OL,20,Fceremony in full. This list will be
OL,21,Fupdatied live throughout the night.
